/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Treat this case separately. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.
-/
theorem exists_poly_ev_line {ι : Type} [Fintype ι] [DecidableEq ι] (f : MvPolynomial (ι × ι) ℚ)
    (A B : Matrix ι ι ℂ) : ∃ p : Polynomial ℂ, ∀ t : ℂ, p.eval t = ev f (A + t • B) := by
  induction f using MvPolynomial.induction_on with
  | C a => exact ⟨Polynomial.C (algebraMap ℚ ℂ a), fun t => by simp [ev]⟩
  | add f g hf hg =>
    obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := hf
    obtain ⟨q, hq⟩ := hg
    refine ⟨p + q, fun t => ?_⟩
    rw [Polynomial.eval_add, hp, hq]
    simp [ev]
  | mul_X f ij hf =>
    obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := hf
    refine ⟨p * (Polynomial.C (A ij.1 ij.2) + Polynomial.X * Polynomial.C (B ij.1 ij.2)), fun t => ?_⟩
    rw [Polynomial.eval_mul, hp, Polynomial.eval_add, Polynomial.eval_mul, Polynomial.eval_C,
      Polynomial.eval_C, Polynomial.eval_X]
    simp [ev]

/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately.

Treat this case separately. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Use the resulting assumption.

Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Establish an intermediate fact. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
